1
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:09,642
Tactical boards keeps every drawing of the staff. Click New board.

2
00:00:09,642 --> 00:00:17,510
Give it a title, pick the sport and the background — whole field, half or a blank board.

3
00:00:17,510 --> 00:00:24,083
Create the board.

4
00:00:24,083 --> 00:00:31,974
Drag players from your roster onto the pitch — their name and number follow them.

5
00:00:31,974 --> 00:00:40,336
Or use the player tools: opponents (B), and a teammate (A) for the corner taker — one click each.

6
00:00:40,336 --> 00:00:45,860
Pick the arrow tool and drag: a run to the near post…

7
00:00:45,860 --> 00:00:53,713
…and a pass. Each arrow can be typed as a pass, a run, a dribble or a shot.

8
00:00:53,713 --> 00:01:00,008
Add a zone, text or equipment the same way. Undo is one click away.

9
00:01:00,008 --> 00:01:07,478
Save. Export a PNG, share it on WhatsApp, or present it full screen in the dressing room.

10
00:01:07,478 --> 00:01:15,332
Back in the list, attach the board to a session so it shows up in the session plan.
